(6196227, 914979, 36843, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, maybe a left side crop would make this pop as little more, nice job</td>', 'I like the shot, maybe a left side crop would make this pop as little more, nice job', '2010-10-20 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196303, 914704, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wow - even after looking the title up on Dogpile, it''s still obscure (although, now I get it - maybe.) The image itself is just confusing me to me (and really noisy.)  I look forward to the end of Voting to read other comments along with yours.</td>', 'Wow - even after looking the title up on Dogpile, it''s still obscure (although, now I get it - maybe.) The image itself is just confusing me to me (and really noisy.)  I look forward to the end of Voting to read other comments along with yours.', '2010-10-20 02:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
