(6196326, 914725, 33736, '<td valign="top">The Windmills are surprisingly quiet (took about 200 pictures of them in September) - but, there is a definite "Swishing" sound.  In this image, the telephone poles are taking as big a role as are the Windmills.  The latter should have a bigger ''role'' in this entry than they do.</td>', 'The Windmills are surprisingly quiet (took about 200 pictures of them in September) - but, there is a definite "Swishing" sound.  In this image, the telephone poles are taking as big a role as are the Windmills.  The latter should have a bigger ''role'' in this entry than they do.', '2010-10-20 02:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196327, 914775, 33736, '<td valign="top">Way cool!</td>', 'Way cool!', '2010-10-20 02:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196329, 915224, 33736, '<td valign="top">Yep - borders are allowed in this Challenge, but why?  I have a feeling that the concept of this is cool, but it doesn''t isn''t quite making it for me.  The foreground edges and front of the drum looks messy and spotty in its exposure.</td>', 'Yep - borders are allowed in this Challenge, but why?  I have a feeling that the concept of this is cool, but it doesn''t isn''t quite making it for me.  The foreground edges and front of the drum looks messy and spotty in its exposure.', '2010-10-20 02:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196330, 915137, 33736, '<td valign="top">Torn on this one...  You just know the Sound is going to be awesome.  However, the glare points are disconcerting.  I''d almost rather ''see'' the Sound from the rear of the Raptor in the form of the blast of air before take-off. (right terminology?)</td>', 'Torn on this one...  You just know the Sound is going to be awesome.  However, the glare points are disconcerting.  I''d almost rather ''see'' the Sound from the rear of the Raptor in the form of the blast of air before take-off. (right terminology?)', '2010-10-20 02:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
