(6196746, 914808, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very clever entry, but I''m not sure it conveys sound. I was originally thinking that a photo that fit the challenge would actually make me hear something when I viewed it. Hearing the dog bark, or the cymbals crash. My first thought was that this didn''t fit the challenge. Yet it makes me think of music, but I still don''t hear it... so I have to ponder this one a little more. (fun shot, though)  (not voting right now)</td>', 'I think this is a very clever entry, but I''m not sure it conveys sound. I was originally thinking that a photo that fit the challenge would actually make me hear something when I viewed it. Hearing the dog bark, or the cymbals crash. My first thought was that this didn''t fit the challenge. Yet it makes me think of music, but I still don''t hear it... so I have to ponder this one a little more. (fun shot, though)  (not voting right now)', '2010-10-20 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196748, 914671, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo -- but I don''t feel it meets the challenge, imo. The photo is supposed to convey sound, yet the person is sitting still, not playing. It actually conveys silence more than sound, imo.<br/> <br/>It''s very striking, however, but I don''t think it fits. (not voting right now)</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo -- but I don''t feel it meets the challenge, imo. The photo is supposed to convey sound, yet the person is sitting still, not playing. It actually conveys silence more than sound, imo. It''s very striking, however, but I don''t think it fits. (not voting right now)', '2010-10-20 12:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196749, 915225, 103142, '<td valign="top">This one seemed like a DNMC, at first glance. But the more I look at it, I can imagine the fwapping sounds and the clink of the weights against the poles. You might get hit by the quick voters, though. (not voting right now)</td>', 'This one seemed like a DNMC, at first glance. But the more I look at it, I can imagine the fwapping sounds and the clink of the weights against the poles. You might get hit by the quick voters, though. (not voting right now)', '2010-10-20 12:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
