(6196752, 915185, 103142, '<td valign="top">I think this one is really stretching it. It really doesn''t seem to convey sound, imo. Most of the time a breeze can hardly be heard, unless it is rustling through leaves or something. You might have been better off with the sound of waves, but even that seems pushing it. I''m sorry... it doesn''t work, imo. (not voting right now)</td>', 'I think this one is really stretching it. It really doesn''t seem to convey sound, imo. Most of the time a breeze can hardly be heard, unless it is rustling through leaves or something. You might have been better off with the sound of waves, but even that seems pushing it. I''m sorry... it doesn''t work, imo. (not voting right now)', '2010-10-20 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196753, 915223, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture, but I don''t think it conveys sound very well. For a harmonica to make sound, someone needs to be playing it. It''s silent when it sits by itself. I''m sorry, but I don''t think this works for the challenge. (not voting right now)</td>', 'This is an interesting picture, but I don''t think it conveys sound very well. For a harmonica to make sound, someone needs to be playing it. It''s silent when it sits by itself. I''m sorry, but I don''t think this works for the challenge. (not voting right now)', '2010-10-20 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
