(6197267, 915386, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very clever but I see wondrous lines and great composition without that noise factor that I am looking for.  If the tree falls in this photo will I be able to hear the crash?  I like the composition and the off center placement of the tree.  The three cloud spots make the photo fabulous as do the three protruding trunks.  I''m not sure if I like or dislike the fact that you left so little dark surface at the bottom of your photo.  I love it but can''t hear a sound.</td>', 'Very clever but I see wondrous lines and great composition without that noise factor that I am looking for.  If the tree falls in this photo will I be able to hear the crash?  I like the composition and the off center placement of the tree.  The three cloud spots make the photo fabulous as do the three protruding trunks.  I''m not sure if I like or dislike the fact that you left so little dark surface at the bottom of your photo.  I love it but can''t hear a sound.', '2010-10-20 23:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197268, 915104, 29777, '<td valign="top">This would improve with some light reflected into the cone and with more detail in the clouds.</td>', 'This would improve with some light reflected into the cone and with more detail in the clouds.', '2010-10-20 23:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
