(6197272, 915376, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''m not frame friendly but I like a good close-up.  Good crop/composition of three main areas.  I liked the blur and depth of your shot with focus on the nimble fingers.  The reflection is my favorite bonus pulling me into the scene by trying to follow the reflected lines that bring me back to the playing hand.  My favorite so far and my third vote after a long time being absent.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m not frame friendly but I like a good close-up.  Good crop/composition of three main areas.  I liked the blur and depth of your shot with focus on the nimble fingers.  The reflection is my favorite bonus pulling me into the scene by trying to follow the reflected lines that bring me back to the playing hand.  My favorite so far and my third vote after a long time being absent.  Good luck.', '2010-10-20 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
