(6197288, 915235, 24511, '<td valign="top">I noticed this one earlier before voting and I must say I did clic to get a closer view.  I love music but not the hair cut because the Bieber just got into an altercation at lasertag with youngsters.  I can feel the emotion of loosing yourself in the rhythm of a song or a beat.  I would have liked that his eyes were not so concerned with gravity and looked somehow inward and in love with the music.  I also though aftewards that the whole body in air seemed too centered.  Best attention grabber for me but only second place as seventh rated photo so far.  Oh sound where are you hidding...</td>', 'I noticed this one earlier before voting and I must say I did clic to get a closer view.  I love music but not the hair cut because the Bieber just got into an altercation at lasertag with youngsters.  I can feel the emotion of loosing yourself in the rhythm of a song or a beat.  I would have liked that his eyes were not so concerned with gravity and looked somehow inward and in love with the music.  I also though aftewards that the whole body in air seemed too centered.  Best attention grabber for me but only second place as seventh rated photo so far.  Oh sound where are you hidding...', '2010-10-21 00:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197292, 915415, 24511, '<td valign="top">Love the chrome, the closeness, being able to read the numbers and the letters and now top three on my list so far but I am still looking for that photo where someone is actually playing that thing to death.  You could have been a contender if you had dared to play a few notes.  My favorite music photo so far.</td>', 'Love the chrome, the closeness, being able to read the numbers and the letters and now top three on my list so far but I am still looking for that photo where someone is actually playing that thing to death.  You could have been a contender if you had dared to play a few notes.  My favorite music photo so far.', '2010-10-21 00:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197294, 915204, 24511, '<td valign="top">I see happy, I even saw an invisible mirror but my best of best for this photo is the eye contact from the left subject that is simply astounding.  Great shot. Fantastic photo but I didn''t hear a thing...just a little giggle.  Thanks for sharing.  Sorry for the scoring.</td>', 'I see happy, I even saw an invisible mirror but my best of best for this photo is the eye contact from the left subject that is simply astounding.  Great shot. Fantastic photo but I didn''t hear a thing...just a little giggle.  Thanks for sharing.  Sorry for the scoring.', '2010-10-21 00:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197296, 915365, 24511, '<td valign="top">Insanity lies here.  I''m very scared now.  I hate scarry movies and this puppy is making me nervous.  I love friendly dogs and I think I can hear this one bark or howl but I just can''t keep my eyes on him long enough to capture the moment.  I have to go now and by the way, I really hate the no background but white effect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Insanity lies here.  I''m very scared now.  I hate scarry movies and this puppy is making me nervous.  I love friendly dogs and I think I can hear this one bark or howl but I just can''t keep my eyes on him long enough to capture the moment.  I have to go now and by the way, I really hate the no background but white effect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-10-21 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197298, 915188, 24511, '<td valign="top">Hmmm!  The teeny tiny sound of an egg cracking open for the first time.  At first glance I though no way will I give a decent score for sound.  The more I looked at this photo, I remembered the movie far and away where a little girl was slowly listening in amazement at geese being hatched and the sound was amplified in stereophonic splendor and orchestration.  I love that movie as I slowly started to love your photo.  It may be too centered for my taste and I did just finished running away from voting for a shockingly fanatic dog entry.  Good effort.  I am still looking for a less subtle sounding photo with a noisy bang and clang.  Yours is smooth and nice and gets the smooth and nice sounding score.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Hmmm!  The teeny tiny sound of an egg cracking open for the first time.  At first glance I though no way will I give a decent score for sound.  The more I looked at this photo, I remembered the movie far and away where a little girl was slowly listening in amazement at geese being hatched and the sound was amplified in stereophonic splendor and orchestration.  I love that movie as I slowly started to love your photo.  It may be too centered for my taste and I did just finished running away from voting for a shockingly fanatic dog entry.  Good effort.  I am still looking for a less subtle sounding photo with a noisy bang and clang.  Yours is smooth and nice and gets the smooth and nice sounding score.  Thanks for sharing.', '2010-10-21 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197299, 915144, 24511, '<td valign="top">It don''t mean a thing if I can''t hear a thing.  I want to be there in person.  I love frogs and critters that make sounds I can''t even discribe.  I would have enjoyed the moment of sound had it been taken at dusk or dawn when the insects and such belt out in resounding song.  This is a great tranquil scene and I want to go sitting in that bench on the right but after twelve votes, I am waiting for someone to make some noise.  Good luck.  PS I had to read the title before grasping your notion of sound vs caption.</td>', 'It don''t mean a thing if I can''t hear a thing.  I want to be there in person.  I love frogs and critters that make sounds I can''t even discribe.  I would have enjoyed the moment of sound had it been taken at dusk or dawn when the insects and such belt out in resounding song.  This is a great tranquil scene and I want to go sitting in that bench on the right but after twelve votes, I am waiting for someone to make some noise.  Good luck.  PS I had to read the title before grasping your notion of sound vs caption.', '2010-10-21 00:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197300, 914632, 24511, '<td valign="top">Not a word.  Just sound.  Love it or leave it.  Are you sure you didn''t copy this one out of an Ansel Adams secret black book treasure box?  Top score so far and I am giving it a 10 but I will return and bump it down to 9 if I find a better one this only being vote number 13.  Are you feeling lucky?</td>', 'Not a word.  Just sound.  Love it or leave it.  Are you sure you didn''t copy this one out of an Ansel Adams secret black book treasure box?  Top score so far and I am giving it a 10 but I will return and bump it down to 9 if I find a better one this only being vote number 13.  Are you feeling lucky?', '2010-10-21 00:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197306, 914979, 24511, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Saturday Nights Live performance.  Those actors of improve extraordinaire have a few things they could learn from you.  Way too weird for me to comment other than stop making all that noise.  Your giving me a headache.  And here I was looking to more noise in the calm and subtle entries that I''ve rated so far.  I take it back.  Give me some quiet noise form now on.  Good entry.  There is no mistaking that wide open mouth for anything other than sound, sound and sound.  Body too centered in the photo could have been sweeter to one side.  The color seemed a little off but I could be falling to the spell of rock and metalic roll.  Good luck.</td>', 'Reminds me of Saturday Nights Live performance.  Those actors of improve extraordinaire have a few things they could learn from you.  Way too weird for me to comment other than stop making all that noise.  Your giving me a headache.  And here I was looking to more noise in the calm and subtle entries that I''ve rated so far.  I take it back.  Give me some quiet noise form now on.  Good entry.  There is no mistaking that wide open mouth for anything other than sound, sound and sound.  Body too centered in the photo could have been sweeter to one side.  The color seemed a little off but I could be falling to the spell of rock and metalic roll.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 00:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197309, 915365, 54645, '<td valign="top">You know, this is rather effective. I can hear.</td>', 'You know, this is rather effective. I can hear.', '2010-10-21 00:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197311, 915385, 24511, '<td valign="top">I must say that the bright notes really distrack a lot from the instrument and the musician.  I like the clarity of the strings and wooden arch below crossed by the swaying bow.  I can''t hear the sound because the bright lights are pulling me away from any scene of sound that may have been played.  It''s like a movie that tells your more than the whole story and forgets that we like a little suspense.  Our imagination of what is heard between the strings can be much lounder than any glaring light shaped notes.  I really loved some photos I''ve rated as much as yours simply because you embraced the theme of sound better but they seemed to handle the technical aspect the the medium better than you...for now.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I must say that the bright notes really distrack a lot from the instrument and the musician.  I like the clarity of the strings and wooden arch below crossed by the swaying bow.  I can''t hear the sound because the bright lights are pulling me away from any scene of sound that may have been played.  It''s like a movie that tells your more than the whole story and forgets that we like a little suspense.  Our imagination of what is heard between the strings can be much lounder than any glaring light shaped notes.  I really loved some photos I''ve rated as much as yours simply because you embraced the theme of sound better but they seemed to handle the technical aspect the the medium better than you...for now.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2010-10-21 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197312, 915392, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great photo, hate frames, top pick and second place in all the photos I''ve rated so far.  I seem to enjoy the photos where nobody is saying anything and the focus is squarely on the pitch and sound of an instrument.  I prefer guitars but your composition is excellent and could be repeated with any struming instrument with success.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Great photo, hate frames, top pick and second place in all the photos I''ve rated so far.  I seem to enjoy the photos where nobody is saying anything and the focus is squarely on the pitch and sound of an instrument.  I prefer guitars but your composition is excellent and could be repeated with any struming instrument with success.  Thanks for sharing.', '2010-10-21 00:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197314, 915221, 24511, '<td valign="top">In your plucking face.  I would have loved more color and even a pick for movement but I did notice after a third glance that strings were vibrating.  That just saved your bacon.  You got sound without the pick so I will bump up your score to six after my initial 5 or even 4 consideration.  Good luck.  I always had a weekness for guitars.</td>', 'In your plucking face.  I would have loved more color and even a pick for movement but I did notice after a third glance that strings were vibrating.  That just saved your bacon.  You got sound without the pick so I will bump up your score to six after my initial 5 or even 4 consideration.  Good luck.  I always had a weekness for guitars.', '2010-10-21 01:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197318, 915139, 24511, '<td valign="top">At first glance I saw lack of focus in the lense but then realised it was a singing bowl and bam...the bottom of the bowl just sprang to light and I forgot the notion of sound looking at lines and shapes in the bottom of the bowl.  Good effort but I miss the sense of movement making sound and I am definitely not a fan of the three white background photos I''ve rated to date.</td>', 'At first glance I saw lack of focus in the lense but then realised it was a singing bowl and bam...the bottom of the bowl just sprang to light and I forgot the notion of sound looking at lines and shapes in the bottom of the bowl.  Good effort but I miss the sense of movement making sound and I am definitely not a fan of the three white background photos I''ve rated to date.', '2010-10-21 01:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197321, 914886, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great pic, really looks old &gt;</td>', 'Great pic, really looks old >', '2010-10-21 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197322, 914865, 24511, '<td valign="top">The problem with a bowl shaped speaker is, well it kind of looks like a bowl.  I love the shot and the vibration visual created with a fantastic shade of blues.  Most appreciated color I''ve seen all challenge.  It even surpassed the blue bird I rated much earlier.  I wanted more punch and I think this is such a great close-up;  Added composition may have bumped up my score if you could have the same shot with someone somehow facing the music.  The white halo looks like underwater bubbles.  Great shot.</td>', 'The problem with a bowl shaped speaker is, well it kind of looks like a bowl.  I love the shot and the vibration visual created with a fantastic shade of blues.  Most appreciated color I''ve seen all challenge.  It even surpassed the blue bird I rated much earlier.  I wanted more punch and I think this is such a great close-up;  Added composition may have bumped up my score if you could have the same shot with someone somehow facing the music.  The white halo looks like underwater bubbles.  Great shot.', '2010-10-21 01:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197327, 914542, 24511, '<td valign="top">I can see there is music in the air but the beige looking ivories just don''t tickle my interest.  I can see how this challenge can be difficult trying to grasp a visual that has no sound and making it pound a note or two.  You followed the theme very well.  I would have liked the bottom right corner to be without that wooden line directed out of the photo.  My favorite part is the green at the top with some bit of rounded metal reflection.  Thanks for the entry and good luck.</td>', 'I can see there is music in the air but the beige looking ivories just don''t tickle my interest.  I can see how this challenge can be difficult trying to grasp a visual that has no sound and making it pound a note or two.  You followed the theme very well.  I would have liked the bottom right corner to be without that wooden line directed out of the photo.  My favorite part is the green at the top with some bit of rounded metal reflection.  Thanks for the entry and good luck.', '2010-10-21 01:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197328, 915406, 24511, '<td valign="top">At first I though an electrical box than I remembered my workplace and still the notion of sound did not come to light until I noticed your alarm title.  Good effort but I was just too distracted to hear the irritating sound I hear every month during fire practice.  Darn I have to work tomorow.  Thanks pal.  Just kidding.  Good luck.</td>', 'At first I though an electrical box than I remembered my workplace and still the notion of sound did not come to light until I noticed your alarm title.  Good effort but I was just too distracted to hear the irritating sound I hear every month during fire practice.  Darn I have to work tomorow.  Thanks pal.  Just kidding.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 01:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197330, 914577, 24511, '<td valign="top">I see the speaker. I listen to the speaker.  I am waiting for sound to come out of the speaker.  Seeing sound is such a work in progress.  I love the fact that it is in the dark with an angle of light from above.  Very geometric.  I need ACDC, guitars and singers with a huge crowd before being thunderstruck.  Good effort.  Thanks.</td>', 'I see the speaker. I listen to the speaker.  I am waiting for sound to come out of the speaker.  Seeing sound is such a work in progress.  I love the fact that it is in the dark with an angle of light from above.  Very geometric.  I need ACDC, guitars and singers with a huge crowd before being thunderstruck.  Good effort.  Thanks.', '2010-10-21 01:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197332, 915160, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great noisy theme nailed.  Hate the background.  The air guitar concert environment was required for a higher score.</td>', 'Great noisy theme nailed.  Hate the background.  The air guitar concert environment was required for a higher score.', '2010-10-21 01:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197333, 915199, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great frozen watercolor effect but nada sound to be heard.  Sorry and good luck next challenge.</td>', 'Great frozen watercolor effect but nada sound to be heard.  Sorry and good luck next challenge.', '2010-10-21 01:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197335, 915383, 24511, '<td valign="top">Slowmotion effect makes me stake a claim that someone put the mute botton on the sound effects.  Crisp and vibrant this has everything I love in a photo.  I just can''t judge a brook by it''s sound color.  I want to take photos like you do.  Good luck.</td>', 'Slowmotion effect makes me stake a claim that someone put the mute botton on the sound effects.  Crisp and vibrant this has everything I love in a photo.  I just can''t judge a brook by it''s sound color.  I want to take photos like you do.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 01:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197339, 915234, 24511, '<td valign="top">Go on and play us a song.  I have to give you less points because the other guitar photo had the strings vibrating while yours are still waiting now and forever to begin.  Love the angle and closeness to the instrument.  My favorite instrument sor I hope I scored you more than the others.  Good luck.</td>', 'Go on and play us a song.  I have to give you less points because the other guitar photo had the strings vibrating while yours are still waiting now and forever to begin.  Love the angle and closeness to the instrument.  My favorite instrument sor I hope I scored you more than the others.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 01:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197340, 914483, 24511, '<td valign="top">A! Is that an A I hear?  Love at first sight.  The used being and been played before close-up is a winner in my book.  I found the other close-up photos of the guitars ok but this is by far my favorite.  I don''t know if it is the lighting or the color but there is shape and composition I just love from start to end.  I will give it a 9 but promise to check the one 10 rated so far and switch if yours is better.  Good luck.</td>', 'A! Is that an A I hear?  Love at first sight.  The used being and been played before close-up is a winner in my book.  I found the other close-up photos of the guitars ok but this is by far my favorite.  I don''t know if it is the lighting or the color but there is shape and composition I just love from start to end.  I will give it a 9 but promise to check the one 10 rated so far and switch if yours is better.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 01:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197341, 915360, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very busy photo.  I am a nature lover and would love to be there in person. I am inclined to think music when I hear the word sound.  My love of music seems to be stronger at this time than my love of nature.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very busy photo.  I am a nature lover and would love to be there in person. I am inclined to think music when I hear the word sound.  My love of music seems to be stronger at this time than my love of nature.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 01:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197342, 914671, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very artistic endeavour but I get the notion that there is no more sound left in this photo.  A bold statement and risk to take as photographer after grasping at the recent cute entries whispering swooshes of soundless meadows with colors, shapes and movement.  The song may be over but that is why the strings are not only on the instruments but sneakers.  Get up and play us another tune will ya!  Very interactive bit of photography for my part. Most difficult photo to judge so far. Good luck.</td>', 'Very artistic endeavour but I get the notion that there is no more sound left in this photo.  A bold statement and risk to take as photographer after grasping at the recent cute entries whispering swooshes of soundless meadows with colors, shapes and movement.  The song may be over but that is why the strings are not only on the instruments but sneakers.  Get up and play us another tune will ya!  Very interactive bit of photography for my part. Most difficult photo to judge so far. Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197343, 915185, 24511, '<td valign="top">The title reminds me of a song but the photo doesn''t inspire sound.  The person very centered in the photo and the whole color seemed to be seen through a filter.  It is a nice pose but it would have been improved perhaps if she were singing a song by the warf.</td>', 'The title reminds me of a song but the photo doesn''t inspire sound.  The person very centered in the photo and the whole color seemed to be seen through a filter.  It is a nice pose but it would have been improved perhaps if she were singing a song by the warf.', '2010-10-21 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197344, 914856, 24511, '<td valign="top">Another booming speaker photo.  It seems to be very popular.  Love the purple shade in the jumping to the beat liquid.  Good luck.</td>', 'Another booming speaker photo.  It seems to be very popular.  Love the purple shade in the jumping to the beat liquid.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197345, 914948, 24511, '<td valign="top">Novel idea.  My first notion was what the heck... Then space and of course the Jody Foster movie.  Points for creativity but an average photo.  How about another at night with shooting star or constalations as a background.  You got me dreaming now.  Good luck.</td>', 'Novel idea.  My first notion was what the heck... Then space and of course the Jody Foster movie.  Points for creativity but an average photo.  How about another at night with shooting star or constalations as a background.  You got me dreaming now.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197346, 914886, 24511, '<td valign="top">Oldie but a goldie.  More points if you were dancing in front of it while someone was turning the crank.</td>', 'Oldie but a goldie.  More points if you were dancing in front of it while someone was turning the crank.', '2010-10-21 02:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197347, 914449, 24511, '<td valign="top">I hear the knocking but find the swishing head distracting.  Good luck</td>', 'I hear the knocking but find the swishing head distracting.  Good luck', '2010-10-21 02:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197348, 915417, 24511, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  So that is what the insides of a dogs mouth looks like.  I can''t say I heard the woof sound as I interpreted the caption as a yawn instead of a bark.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool photo.  So that is what the insides of a dogs mouth looks like.  I can''t say I heard the woof sound as I interpreted the caption as a yawn instead of a bark.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197350, 914808, 24511, '<td valign="top">What a nutty photo.  You must be nuts to enter this photo in this challenge.  Oh well, I do like foolish hearts so what ta hey.  Take five but only this once.  Never again will I give such high scores for a bland white background.  Be warned and good luck.</td>', 'What a nutty photo.  You must be nuts to enter this photo in this challenge.  Oh well, I do like foolish hearts so what ta hey.  Take five but only this once.  Never again will I give such high scores for a bland white background.  Be warned and good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197352, 914527, 24511, '<td valign="top">That old black magic is again in front of me.  Strumming strings will get you 5 to life.  I love this instrument and enjoyed the angle and color and lighting.  If not for the colored pink-a-dots I would have scored you more.</td>', 'That old black magic is again in front of me.  Strumming strings will get you 5 to life.  I love this instrument and enjoyed the angle and color and lighting.  If not for the colored pink-a-dots I would have scored you more.', '2010-10-21 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197353, 914963, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great psycho-colorific but no actual playing of sound.  Simply symbolic and not a great earful.  It sure put a little color in this challenge and brought it well above normalistically considered insane.  Thanks.</td>', 'Great psycho-colorific but no actual playing of sound.  Simply symbolic and not a great earful.  It sure put a little color in this challenge and brought it well above normalistically considered insane.  Thanks.', '2010-10-21 02:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197354, 915138, 24511, '<td valign="top">Breaking the sound barrier puches a chunk of sound but all I got from this photo was great patterns and balance.  Loved the photo but not for the sound challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Breaking the sound barrier puches a chunk of sound but all I got from this photo was great patterns and balance.  Loved the photo but not for the sound challenge.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197355, 914926, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loved the shot but I like color unless you have a greater variety of contrast maybe created by lighting or lighting changes. Good luck</td>', 'Loved the shot but I like color unless you have a greater variety of contrast maybe created by lighting or lighting changes. Good luck', '2010-10-21 02:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197361, 915104, 24511, '<td valign="top">This was the only photo so far that got me to think uh.  I really could not and still can''t seem to grasp the idea of speaker and sound.  It seems huge and not speaker like.  Is this a minie speaker captured from underneath to make it seem humongus?  The composition is well devided but something seems missing.  Good luck.</td>', 'This was the only photo so far that got me to think uh.  I really could not and still can''t seem to grasp the idea of speaker and sound.  It seems huge and not speaker like.  Is this a minie speaker captured from underneath to make it seem humongus?  The composition is well devided but something seems missing.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197362, 914822, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great lines, great colors, love the sky but can''t hear traffic.  Again when I see this effect of slow capture I feel a mute button has been pressed.</td>', 'Great lines, great colors, love the sky but can''t hear traffic.  Again when I see this effect of slow capture I feel a mute button has been pressed.', '2010-10-21 02:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197363, 915225, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very patriotic looking but I don''t know too many american songs.  I do love the sound of waving flags but I''ve videotaped them too many times to get the same effect out of a still camera.</td>', 'Very patriotic looking but I don''t know too many american songs.  I do love the sound of waving flags but I''ve videotaped them too many times to get the same effect out of a still camera.', '2010-10-21 02:44:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6197364, 914806, 24511, '<td valign="top">Weeeeeee, I love this one.  A bit of humour and movement with the distinct sound effect I''ve been looking for.  Top three vote for me.  Good luck for putting us all to shame.</td>', 'Weeeeeee, I love this one.  A bit of humour and movement with the distinct sound effect I''ve been looking for.  Top three vote for me.  Good luck for putting us all to shame.', '2010-10-21 02:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197365, 915157, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very sensual, movement overtakes the notion of sound but who cares.  I love the colors and lighting variations.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very sensual, movement overtakes the notion of sound but who cares.  I love the colors and lighting variations.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197366, 915433, 24511, '<td valign="top">Pretty religious title with calm soothing caption.  Nice misty feeling photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Pretty religious title with calm soothing caption.  Nice misty feeling photo.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197367, 914980, 24511, '<td valign="top">Nothing sounds good unless you add a little bit of rock''n roll baby.  Crazy too busy but a Peavey Sports fan.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nothing sounds good unless you add a little bit of rock''n roll baby.  Crazy too busy but a Peavey Sports fan.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 02:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197369, 915161, 24511, '<td valign="top">Solace at first glance then I notice a spider ring and imagine a blues or cajun soul playing tune master at work apprentice.  I love that this photo leaves a lot to the imagination.  Oh yeah, I also love the leaves.  I didn''t like the hat being chopped from above and I would of liked more variation and less monocromatic tones.</td>', 'Solace at first glance then I notice a spider ring and imagine a blues or cajun soul playing tune master at work apprentice.  I love that this photo leaves a lot to the imagination.  Oh yeah, I also love the leaves.  I didn''t like the hat being chopped from above and I would of liked more variation and less monocromatic tones.', '2010-10-21 02:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197370, 915123, 24511, '<td valign="top">Friendly movement photo fun but no sound connection unless there is music in the air.  Good luck</td>', 'Friendly movement photo fun but no sound connection unless there is music in the air.  Good luck', '2010-10-21 02:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197371, 914612, 24511, '<td valign="top">Felt like I was looking at a painting.  Thanks for the title so I can understand the sound link.  Good luck</td>', 'Felt like I was looking at a painting.  Thanks for the title so I can understand the sound link.  Good luck', '2010-10-21 02:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197373, 915237, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great still photo but who is making the sound break out of it.  I would have liked more focus in the photo.  Good luck</td>', 'Great still photo but who is making the sound break out of it.  I would have liked more focus in the photo.  Good luck', '2010-10-21 03:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197374, 914610, 24511, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to hear sounds from this plant photo.  I must search my soul for all I see is a blue giant lady about to use her bow and arrow with a seed floating quietly from the sky.  Good luck.</td>', 'I can''t seem to hear sounds from this plant photo.  I must search my soul for all I see is a blue giant lady about to use her bow and arrow with a seed floating quietly from the sky.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 03:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197376, 915404, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great season of fall color but the leaves aren''t making any noise unless there is wind or walking on the leaves happening.  Great nature shot and enjoyed the hanging branches above.</td>', 'Great season of fall color but the leaves aren''t making any noise unless there is wind or walking on the leaves happening.  Great nature shot and enjoyed the hanging branches above.', '2010-10-21 03:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197377, 915227, 24511, '<td valign="top">Good sound check.  First mike I''ve seen all challenge.  Not much color but cute smile and great crop and composition.</td>', 'Good sound check.  First mike I''ve seen all challenge.  Not much color but cute smile and great crop and composition.', '2010-10-21 03:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
