(6197410, 915433, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot and if I was allowed 100 single words to try and describe this shot Sound would not have been there.  So I''m affraid it''s a DNMC from me (despite the title).  So this gets a 5 from me which is the highest I give for a DNMC which shows how much I really like this shot.<br/> <br/>Ok, I''ve come back to this shot 4 times so something is intruiging and bothering me.  After participating in some discussions in the scoring thread I''m reconsidering some of my previous voting and and this is one where I can now see (hear?) the sound.  I still feel it''s a bit of a shoehorn but a beautiful one at that so I''m bumping to an 8.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot and if I was allowed 100 single words to try and describe this shot Sound would not have been there.  So I''m affraid it''s a DNMC from me (despite the title).  So this gets a 5 from me which is the highest I give for a DNMC which shows how much I really like this shot. Ok, I''ve come back to this shot 4 times so something is intruiging and bothering me.  After participating in some discussions in the scoring thread I''m reconsidering some of my previous voting and and this is one where I can now see (hear?) the sound.  I still feel it''s a bit of a shoehorn but a beautiful one at that so I''m bumping to an 8.', '2010-10-21 04:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197412, 915144, 40391, '<td valign="top">I originally gave this a 4 as I struggled to see how it met the challenge even though I thought it was a lovely shot.  However, I''ve been convinced to revisit some shots and this is one where I believe I missed the true meaning of the shot.  The colours are lovely, the reflection great and the composition was perfect.  Bumped to a 7</td>', 'I originally gave this a 4 as I struggled to see how it met the challenge even though I thought it was a lovely shot.  However, I''ve been convinced to revisit some shots and this is one where I believe I missed the true meaning of the shot.  The colours are lovely, the reflection great and the composition was perfect.  Bumped to a 7', '2010-10-21 05:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197413, 915137, 40391, '<td valign="top">If a Raptor is resting on the handstand does it make a sound?  Mmmm<br/> <br/>Much more philosophical than a falling tree, especially considering the potential of the loud Raptor.  Still, a bit too much of a shoehorn for me. 4.  (I do like the shot though, including the halo!)<br/> <br/>I''m revisiting my shots and reconsidering some of my voting.  This is one I feel I was a bit harsh with my voting and am bumping yours to a 7</td>', 'If a Raptor is resting on the handstand does it make a sound?  Mmmm Much more philosophical than a falling tree, especially considering the potential of the loud Raptor.  Still, a bit too much of a shoehorn for me. 4.  (I do like the shot though, including the halo!) I''m revisiting my shots and reconsidering some of my voting.  This is one I feel I was a bit harsh with my voting and am bumping yours to a 7', '2010-10-21 05:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197414, 915405, 40391, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before and you have done a great job reduing this shot.  Lovely colours, great capture and my equal top pick of the challenge. I scored this a 9 earlier.</td>', 'I''ve seen this before and you have done a great job reduing this shot.  Lovely colours, great capture and my equal top pick of the challenge. I scored this a 9 earlier.', '2010-10-21 05:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
