(6197515, 915204, 86447, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  I can hear them giggling!  LOL!<br/> <br/>BTW, no apostrophe is proper for your title.   One whisper   Two whispers<br/> <br/>If something belonged to the whisper it would use an apostrophe.    A whisper''s voice<br/> <br/>or... (now I''m bordering on an entire lesson here.  LOL!)   two whispers'' voices<br/> <br/> <br/>Ok... we now return to the photo comments... *smile*  It''s a 7 for me.   Well done.</td>', 'Adorable!  I can hear them giggling!  LOL! BTW, no apostrophe is proper for your title.   One whisper   Two whispers If something belonged to the whisper it would use an apostrophe.    A whisper''s voice or... (now I''m bordering on an entire lesson here.  LOL!)   two whispers'' voices  Ok... we now return to the photo comments... *smile*  It''s a 7 for me.   Well done.', '2010-10-21 10:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
