(6197739, 915188, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I can hear the egg being chopped open and the bird taking its first chirps. I maybe have even cropped a little tighter to get less of the grass in the photo.</td>', 'Great idea. I can hear the egg being chopped open and the bird taking its first chirps. I maybe have even cropped a little tighter to get less of the grass in the photo.', '2010-10-21 15:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
