(6197743, 915179, 114225, '<td valign="top">The idea you have is good, but I think the photo lacks a real subject. It took me a while before I eventually found the horn here. Maybe a better way to depict this would be a different perspective (partially looking into the horn may be good) and tighter crop.</td>', 'The idea you have is good, but I think the photo lacks a real subject. It took me a while before I eventually found the horn here. Maybe a better way to depict this would be a different perspective (partially looking into the horn may be good) and tighter crop.', '2010-10-21 15:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
