(6197958, 915389, 24511, '<td valign="top">Aha!  I see the rainbow in the bottom left corner.  Do I get a treasure?  My favorite place to be.  I held hands with someone who is dear to me here for the first time.  Love the movement of water we can''t see.  That mist keeps hiding so much water flow.  Very quaint tourist scene but my first thought was not roar or sound.  I love the upper right corner ledge of the fall.  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Aha!  I see the rainbow in the bottom left corner.  Do I get a treasure?  My favorite place to be.  I held hands with someone who is dear to me here for the first time.  Love the movement of water we can''t see.  That mist keeps hiding so much water flow.  Very quaint tourist scene but my first thought was not roar or sound.  I love the upper right corner ledge of the fall.  Good luck with the challenge.', '2010-10-21 21:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197963, 914704, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract, however, I''m having trouble relating it to "sound."</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract, however, I''m having trouble relating it to "sound."', '2010-10-21 21:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
