(6197966, 915157, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I like the motion.</td>', 'Great capture. I like the motion.', '2010-10-21 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197967, 915375, 24511, '<td valign="top">Whoah this is a very busy photo.  I could search for this and that all day long and keep myself interested.  Earphone and drumstick movement nails the sound theme for me.  I would have liked the photo less centered.  Enjoyed the darker shades in the body suit and base drum.  Love color better than black and white unless there is a good dose of lights mixed with darks.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Whoah this is a very busy photo.  I could search for this and that all day long and keep myself interested.  Earphone and drumstick movement nails the sound theme for me.  I would have liked the photo less centered.  Enjoyed the darker shades in the body suit and base drum.  Love color better than black and white unless there is a good dose of lights mixed with darks.  Thanks for sharing.', '2010-10-21 21:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197968, 915406, 29777, '<td valign="top">I get the tie in to the challenge, but it seems a stretch. Technically the shot could be sharper and it looks a bit noisy. Lastly, the composition is dull. It would be more interesting with an interesting angle and a moody glow from the keypad.</td>', 'I get the tie in to the challenge, but it seems a stretch. Technically the shot could be sharper and it looks a bit noisy. Lastly, the composition is dull. It would be more interesting with an interesting angle and a moody glow from the keypad.', '2010-10-21 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
