(6197979, 915191, 24511, '<td valign="top">Class act photo.  I could see this in a folded handout at the opening night musical Arts festival.  Very user friendly image.  Cute lighting on set.  Sounds good to me.  Cello reflection lower center floor my favorite.  Tape on floor on light cord not my favorite.</td>', 'Class act photo.  I could see this in a folded handout at the opening night musical Arts festival.  Very user friendly image.  Cute lighting on set.  Sounds good to me.  Cello reflection lower center floor my favorite.  Tape on floor on light cord not my favorite.', '2010-10-21 21:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197980, 915237, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the way the colors fade into the distance. The problem I have with the shot is that the point of interest seems to be the tuning machines. These aren''t interesting to me, however, the strings and frets would be interesting. Maybe a deep DOF rather than shallow would have been a better choice.</td>', 'I like the way the colors fade into the distance. The problem I have with the shot is that the point of interest seems to be the tuning machines. These aren''t interesting to me, however, the strings and frets would be interesting. Maybe a deep DOF rather than shallow would have been a better choice.', '2010-10-21 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197983, 915199, 29777, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting how this ties into wind chimes or sound. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m not getting how this ties into wind chimes or sound. Sorry.', '2010-10-21 21:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197985, 914483, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. The only thing I''m not sure about is the shadow of the fretboard on the body.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. The only thing I''m not sure about is the shadow of the fretboard on the body.', '2010-10-21 21:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197995, 915223, 24511, '<td valign="top">Brush of blue rush blur had me blinking for focus.  Kind of had me wonder if this was a perspective trick that kept me from seeing clearly.  I had to put on my glasses.  I enjoyed at once the X-wing upper right just at the perfect spot and the clear mailbox blast of color bottom left again just spot on.  I hate this photo without my glasses but love it with them on.  Weird or what to think.  I knew it was an instrument and would have given more points if it were played.  Being the only photo that played with my eyes and changed my view from irritable to cool special effects...from 4-5 initial guess due to the lovely blues, I finally wiped my eyes and settled for a resounding 8 because of the journey I enjoyed tremendously.</td>', 'Brush of blue rush blur had me blinking for focus.  Kind of had me wonder if this was a perspective trick that kept me from seeing clearly.  I had to put on my glasses.  I enjoyed at once the X-wing upper right just at the perfect spot and the clear mailbox blast of color bottom left again just spot on.  I hate this photo without my glasses but love it with them on.  Weird or what to think.  I knew it was an instrument and would have given more points if it were played.  Being the only photo that played with my eyes and changed my view from irritable to cool special effects...from 4-5 initial guess due to the lovely blues, I finally wiped my eyes and settled for a resounding 8 because of the journey I enjoyed tremendously.', '2010-10-21 21:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197998, 915143, 24511, '<td valign="top">At first glance I focused on the wall and architecture more than the instrument.  I can immagine the player blowing his tuba type instrument but found many small distractions at the bottom corner areas.  I gave low points but would have given top scores for a close-up shot of the reflection in the golden saucer area.  I think it was the most amazing part of this photo but it was lost in the immensity of the budding crowd and grandios structure.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'At first glance I focused on the wall and architecture more than the instrument.  I can immagine the player blowing his tuba type instrument but found many small distractions at the bottom corner areas.  I gave low points but would have given top scores for a close-up shot of the reflection in the golden saucer area.  I think it was the most amazing part of this photo but it was lost in the immensity of the budding crowd and grandios structure.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-10-21 21:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197999, 915137, 24511, '<td valign="top">Awsome color changes and lines.  One of my favorite photos even if the sky seems artificial.  Can''t seem to grasp the sound theme as well as some of the other entries.  Good luck</td>', 'Awsome color changes and lines.  One of my favorite photos even if the sky seems artificial.  Can''t seem to grasp the sound theme as well as some of the other entries.  Good luck', '2010-10-21 21:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198001, 914775, 24511, '<td valign="top">I just love guitars.  Great color tone and the black background complements the clarity of lines and waves.  I enjoyed the special effect of the hand in front of the strings but can''t seem to understand who to get the hand into the caramel bar.  I mean the hand behind the strings and into the sound box.  The coolness of this photo is more present at first glance than the novelty seemed to wear off over time.  Very very good entry.  I like guitars.  What can I say.  If you have a guitar and I''m voting, you get credits. Good luck.</td>', 'I just love guitars.  Great color tone and the black background complements the clarity of lines and waves.  I enjoyed the special effect of the hand in front of the strings but can''t seem to understand who to get the hand into the caramel bar.  I mean the hand behind the strings and into the sound box.  The coolness of this photo is more present at first glance than the novelty seemed to wear off over time.  Very very good entry.  I like guitars.  What can I say.  If you have a guitar and I''m voting, you get credits. Good luck.', '2010-10-21 21:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198003, 914791, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure you can enter art as the main subject in a challenge but this clay looking beast does seem to be giving out more than a hoot.  I found the photo very bright and the circular lines in the sky distracting.</td>', 'I''m not sure you can enter art as the main subject in a challenge but this clay looking beast does seem to be giving out more than a hoot.  I found the photo very bright and the circular lines in the sky distracting.', '2010-10-21 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198004, 914704, 24511, '<td valign="top">This one is just too avant guard for me to even attempt to describe.  At first it seemed a smoking blur gun.  Then I thought hey a sound wave that has a technical jargon attached.  Still photo shapes very interesting but costly for points towards a sounding goal.</td>', 'This one is just too avant guard for me to even attempt to describe.  At first it seemed a smoking blur gun.  Then I thought hey a sound wave that has a technical jargon attached.  Still photo shapes very interesting but costly for points towards a sounding goal.', '2010-10-21 22:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198009, 915391, 24511, '<td valign="top">I love the photo. Then I saw the title and I hate the song.  I needed to hide the title before voting otherwise I would have given you one of my lowest 2 scores.  I usually hate blur but this one stuck to my back bone.  Don''t like the knee at the bottom center edge of the photo but loved everything else.  Love guitars, love the hand movements and the different textures of the background bottom right and upper left.  I would have only liked the artists face and/or the face of the guitar to be more in focus in contrast to the bluring movements.</td>', 'I love the photo. Then I saw the title and I hate the song.  I needed to hide the title before voting otherwise I would have given you one of my lowest 2 scores.  I usually hate blur but this one stuck to my back bone.  Don''t like the knee at the bottom center edge of the photo but loved everything else.  Love guitars, love the hand movements and the different textures of the background bottom right and upper left.  I would have only liked the artists face and/or the face of the guitar to be more in focus in contrast to the bluring movements.', '2010-10-21 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198010, 914556, 24511, '<td valign="top">Wowing mesmerized me with the big eyes for voting high scores but I don''t hear him hooting at all.  I realy want that beak to speak.  I guess that is why nature photographers are such a patient lot waiting day''s, weeks and plus that we in a challenge don''t have.  If his/her beak were open, I would have given a 7 to 9 score for sure.  Nice clear bird photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wowing mesmerized me with the big eyes for voting high scores but I don''t hear him hooting at all.  I realy want that beak to speak.  I guess that is why nature photographers are such a patient lot waiting day''s, weeks and plus that we in a challenge don''t have.  If his/her beak were open, I would have given a 7 to 9 score for sure.  Nice clear bird photo.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 22:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198018, 914908, 24511, '<td valign="top">My first thought was oh no...not another no sounder nature clic. Then I quickly started to hear thunder in the distance.  After writing this I just looked up again and I could actually hear the breeze and wind that pushed all that line filled coastal stuff up the ledge.  I hate myself for scoring so high but I can''t fool myself that this photo was the one smoking gun wondrous caption that spoke to my innerdly gut sounding soul.  I just hate you so much right now.  Go away and thanks for setting the bar even higher.  Everybody wants to be like you.</td>', 'My first thought was oh no...not another no sounder nature clic. Then I quickly started to hear thunder in the distance.  After writing this I just looked up again and I could actually hear the breeze and wind that pushed all that line filled coastal stuff up the ledge.  I hate myself for scoring so high but I can''t fool myself that this photo was the one smoking gun wondrous caption that spoke to my innerdly gut sounding soul.  I just hate you so much right now.  Go away and thanks for setting the bar even higher.  Everybody wants to be like you.', '2010-10-21 22:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198027, 914725, 24511, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset but a reflective copy of the sun is distracting.  I bet one of the sites specialists could explain how we can avoid this.  I know from experience that photography into sunlight can be tricky.  I found with limited skill that my video camera takes better photos than my Nikon D70.  As you can imagine I have a lot to learn.  For now your photo does not sound louder than other challengers entries for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice sunset but a reflective copy of the sun is distracting.  I bet one of the sites specialists could explain how we can avoid this.  I know from experience that photography into sunlight can be tricky.  I found with limited skill that my video camera takes better photos than my Nikon D70.  As you can imagine I have a lot to learn.  For now your photo does not sound louder than other challengers entries for me.  Good luck.', '2010-10-21 22:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198030, 914725, 29777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful golden capture, but DNMC.</td>', 'Beautiful golden capture, but DNMC.', '2010-10-21 22:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198033, 915405, 24511, '<td valign="top">Icecream yummie color mixtures and shape made me think more of movement and vibration than sound.  I know, I know sound is made of vibration and speakers, even if we can''t see them, can boom boom liquid into space but I can''t hear the sound even if I love the visual and seductive attraction I get by looking at this great shot.  Thanks for sharing</td>', 'Icecream yummie color mixtures and shape made me think more of movement and vibration than sound.  I know, I know sound is made of vibration and speakers, even if we can''t see them, can boom boom liquid into space but I can''t hear the sound even if I love the visual and seductive attraction I get by looking at this great shot.  Thanks for sharing', '2010-10-21 22:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6198036, 915231, 24511, '<td valign="top">Loud and clear. I can hear you from across the room without a doubt.  Fun, party atmosphere, a little busy and would have liked the main character second to the left to be less centered.</td>', 'Loud and clear. I can hear you from across the room without a doubt.  Fun, party atmosphere, a little busy and would have liked the main character second to the left to be less centered.', '2010-10-21 22:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
