(6201828, 914704, 101702, '<td valign="top">Not really getting any sense of sound from this, sorry. Obviously the title alludes to the islands in Greek Mythology from which Siren''s lured sailors to their deaths, but without the title, I don''t get any sense of sound. I quite like the image as an abstract, but the link to the challenge is too tenuous for me to perceive. Therefore I will be knocking a couple of points of for my perception that this DNMC.</td>', 'Not really getting any sense of sound from this, sorry. Obviously the title alludes to the islands in Greek Mythology from which Siren''s lured sailors to their deaths, but without the title, I don''t get any sense of sound. I quite like the image as an abstract, but the link to the challenge is too tenuous for me to perceive. Therefore I will be knocking a couple of points of for my perception that this DNMC.', '2010-10-26 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6201831, 915185, 101702, '<td valign="top">Not getting any sense of sound from this image, as nice as it is. Can''t say I''ve ever heard a summer breeze, maybe my ears don''t work too good. Without the title, I''d see no link to the challenge. Pretty model, nice dress, nice location, but still, my perception is that this does not meet the challenge. Therefore I will be knocking a couple of points off.</td>', 'Not getting any sense of sound from this image, as nice as it is. Can''t say I''ve ever heard a summer breeze, maybe my ears don''t work too good. Without the title, I''d see no link to the challenge. Pretty model, nice dress, nice location, but still, my perception is that this does not meet the challenge. Therefore I will be knocking a couple of points off.', '2010-10-26 16:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6202017, 915157, 120058, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of the song "Reinventing Axl Rose" bu Against Me! <br/> <br/>"And we would dance like no one was watching - With one fist in the air"</td>', 'Makes me think of the song "Reinventing Axl Rose" bu Against Me!  "And we would dance like no one was watching - With one fist in the air"', '2010-10-26 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
