(6202400, 915217, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the contrast on this one -- it''s such a clean, crisp image. (not crisp because of sharpening, but crisp because of the contrast.) Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'Love the lighting and the contrast on this one -- it''s such a clean, crisp image. (not crisp because of sharpening, but crisp because of the contrast.) Congrats on the top 10!', '2010-10-27 07:43:58.000000', NULL, 0),
