(6203461, 914612, 103142, '<td valign="top">I do like this one very much -- it was one of my 8s. It makes you hear the rain against the window and the wind. It also gives you the cozy feeling of being inside. It evokes a lot on many levels. Beautifully done, severely underrated.</td>', 'I do like this one very much -- it was one of my 8s. It makes you hear the rain against the window and the wind. It also gives you the cozy feeling of being inside. It evokes a lot on many levels. Beautifully done, severely underrated.', '2010-10-28 11:00:59.000000', NULL, 0),
